            Every pick has a distinct job. One is the everyday all-rounder, one is the bulk cleanup option, one is made for fine-art oil painters, one is real pine turpentine for people who specifically want it, one is the low-VOC option, and two are the conditioners that solve the problems most people are actually trying to fix when they reach for a thinner.
          </p>
